@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-72 - Open Conversation (Admin)

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Chat Widget / Admin Chat UI" as FE
control "ChatController" as API
control "ChatService" as Service
database "MongoDB: chatConversations" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-72
FE -> API: GET /chat/conversations/:id
API -> Service: Execute Open Conversation (Admin)
Service -> DB: Read/write chatConversations
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Lịch sử chat hiển thị

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Conversation tồn tại
Post: Lịch sử chat hiển thị
Main flow:
1. Admin click vào conversation
2. System gọi API GET /chat/conversations/:id
3. System trả về messages[]
4. Admin đọc tin nhắn
5. System đánh dấu đã đọc (PATCH /chat/conversations/:id/read)
end note
@enduml
